{
  "bookId": "rewind-49",
  "id": "chapter-200",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "40601001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "现在我已把我的魔法尽行抛弃，剩余微弱的力量都属于我自己。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601002",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "——威廉·莎士比亚《暴风雨》",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "等、等一下？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "锐利的斩击堪堪从你的翅膀边扫过，将路边的易拉罐一分为二。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "我们之前认识吗？为什么要追着我砍？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "身为塑料配件却能口吐人言……真是有趣的猎物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40601008",
              "text": "我也不知道我是什么情况。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40601008",
              "text": "咱们能不能先聊聊？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40601007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "放心，你不会感到痛。死亡只是回归黑暗的一种方式。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40601010",
              "text": "这谁能放心啊？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40601010",
              "text": "这家伙好像有什么大病……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40601009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "今夜，我将为「它」的归来而献礼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "糟糕……怎么是死路……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "刀锋挟着风压袭来，这一击避无可避，乌鸦闭上眼——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601013",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "咣！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "唷，你应该是能飞的吧？怎么不知道往上面逃？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "映入眼帘的是漆黑的裙甲和宵色的剑，少女的身姿宛如一道幻影。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "啊？我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "等一下，这股不洁的气息……难道说，我们是同类？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "闭嘴。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "只会欺负弱者的杂鱼，就不要攀亲带故了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40601021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "代号v",
          "text": "你……好，很好，就把你变成新的祭品吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "战斗在几个瞬间后便宣告结束。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "这下总算清净了。果然这个城市和N城一样，也是乱七八糟的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800003",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "少女啧了一声，接着便迈动脚步，似乎即将离去。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "啊，请等一下！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "什么事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "……谢谢你救我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "别会错意了，我只是忍不了有人在眼前搞什么低劣的动作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "可以告诉我你的名字吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "好吧。我是流浪骑士诺伊尔，诺——伊——尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800010",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "诺伊尔 · 宵暗之刃\n商品名称：诺伊尔·宵暗之刃 Ver.\n作品出处：《永恒的异界幻想》\n制造商：TENMA 天马\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约232mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40800012",
              "text": "我记住了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40800012",
              "text": "为什么要重复一遍？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40800011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "对了，如果你过意不去，倒可以帮我个小忙——「日光乐园」该怎么走？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "……我不知道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "哈？你也不是本地的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "这个我不太清楚，老实说，我……失忆了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "我一醒来就发现自己是只会思考的乌鸦但完全想不起之前的事接着就遇到了追着砍的疯子然后逃到巷子里被你救了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "噢，哦，原来是……一只会说人话的失忆乌鸦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "感谢分享，那我们就此别过。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40800021",
              "text": "这反应不太对吧？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40800021",
              "text": "你就不觉得好奇吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40800020",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我可不是什么正义的伙伴，事事都操心不是累死。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "有什么生活困难可以去找管理局，那帮税金小偷这点事总能搞定吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40800024",
              "text": "好的。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40800024",
              "text": "管理局是什么来着？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40800023",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "再见咯，小乌鸦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40800025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "她就这样离开了小巷。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-992",
