      "title": "魔女集会·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "40602001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "清晨，潮酷街区——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602003",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "灰粉发的少女信手展开随身携带的信函，上面是她看了无数遍的信息。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "……等下，我怎么认识上面的字？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "在距离稍远的位置，你正隐藏在建筑的阴影里，观察着昨晚见过一面的少女。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "魔女集会……什么意思？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "周六上午十点，日光乐园……那不是等下就要开始了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "被发现了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "少女投来的视线仿佛一道寒冰的箭矢，你顿时缩了下去。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我只数三下，如果还不现身，就把你和藏身处一起轰飞。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "……来真的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "3……2……时间到！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "喂，停！还没数1呢？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "哦，原来是你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "十秒钟，解释清楚你跟踪我的意图。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "……我可以带你去日光乐园。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "有意思，窥探者。你不是失忆了吗？怎么现在突然认识路了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "我确实不记得以前的事了，但总感觉这个地方很熟悉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "你望着这条街道的景色，它与脑海深处的模糊印象相吻合。你可能曾多次行走在这条街上……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "……「行走」？为什么不是飞的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "越来越可疑了呢，你不会以为失忆是很吃香的搭讪借口吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "我不知道该去哪，但如果跟着你在这边逛，说不定能想起些什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我说过，我不是什么正义的——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "让我做你的向导吧，诺伊尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "毕竟我会飞啊，到空中去探路明显方便很多。而且你不是正好迷路了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "什么迷路，我只是在慢悠悠地观光而已！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "那么，这个交易怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602030",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "少女的眼神放空了一下，似乎被当前的情境勾起了回忆。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "呵……也就是说，你想要成为我的使魔，是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40602033",
              "text": "这有什么问题吗?"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40602033",
              "text": "为什么是一副要把我吃了的表情？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40602032",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "你显然并不知晓我曾经的名号。否则，你便不会提出如此无知的要约。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "听好了，在汝面前显现的即是群鸦的魔女，此世最优秀的奥术法师，同时也是一名孤高的流浪骑士。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "现在，你还想要和我一同前往深渊吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40602037",
              "text": "……设定也太多了吧！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40602037",
              "text": "魔女是指……魔法少女吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40602036",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "真是不知道天高地厚呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "算了，那我就勉为其难地，在路上教教你吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "原来我已经算入伙了吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "既然是我的使魔了，总要有个名字吧。你还记得自己叫什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "……还是想不起来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "好吧，我理解，等你有头绪了再告诉我吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40602043",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "【乌鸦】加入了【魔女诺伊尔】的队伍。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-993",
